Avaritia: Ultimate is a Bedrock port based on the following projects.

1. Re:Avaritia [Forge/Fabric/NeoForge]
   https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/re-avaritia
   Owner: cnlimiter
   Programmers: cnlimiter, IAFEnvoy, Frostbite-time, cu6, MikhailTapio, Asek3
   Artists: MHanHanBing, Neo-Tix
   Source: https://github.com/Nova-Committee/Avaritia-Reforge
   License: code MIT; assets CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see above)

2. Avaritia : Expand
   https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-expand
   Author: cu6
   Source: https://github.com/Nova-Committee/AvaritiaExpand
   License: MIT (as listed on its CurseForge page)

3. Avaritia Spear
   https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/avaritia-spear
   Author: lying_ice
   License: MIT (as listed on its CurseForge page)

4. Some animations used with permission and credit: Athan213
   https://youtube.com/@athan213

Re:Avaritia is itself a reforged version of the original Avaritia mod.

